{"sourceUrl":"https://cis.swu.edu.cn/info/1145/5987.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:27.646898+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cis.swu.edu.cn/info/1145/5987.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><strong><span><span>西南大学计算机与信息科学学院</span> <span>软件学院</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>关于接收</span></span></strong><strong><span>2027</span></strong><strong><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>初）试攻读研究生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>的预报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>通知</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>西南大学热忱欢迎全国优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读我校硕士研究生！为做好接收</span>2027<span>年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，我院将开展接收推免生预报名工作，欢迎广大推免生报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）具有推免资格的本科培养单位推荐的、具有免（初）试攻读研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院在</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span>http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>可选报的</span></span><span><span>全日制硕士招生专业均可接收硕士推免生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>最终以</span><span>“</span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>填报专业为准</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名和复试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、报名时间：</span></span><span>2026<span>年</span><span>09</span><span>月</span><span>05</span><span>日至0</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>（</span><span>17:00</span><span>前）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、凡符合上述</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>条件且有意愿报考我校的优秀应届本科毕业生（包括本校和外校），请于报名时间内登录</span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>（</span><span>http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/</span><span>），</span></span><span><span>按要求上传相关材料</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>完成报名信息</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名所需提交相关材料如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）本人详细简历（包括本科专业背景、学习科研情况等）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）</span></span><span><span>本人</span></span><span><span>学生证、第二代身份证正反面</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）本科阶段学习成绩单和专业排名证明，须加盖院系或教务部门公章；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）大学英语四、六级考试成绩单或托福、雅思等英语水平的证明；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>其他各种学业能力证明材料（如获奖证书、本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>要求：上传文件按照顺序扫描或合并成</span>1<span>个</span><span>pdf</span><span>文件且大小不要超过</span><span>8M</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3、预推免进群：为方便联系和通知，请拟申请我院</span><span>2027</span><span>级推免生的同学加入</span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span><span>924220057</span><span>（进群请修改备注名为：本科学校+姓名+报考专业）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>将对</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>提交的所有材料进行审查</span></span><span><span>，择优确定</span></span><span><span>复试名单并发出通知，请考生及时关注</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>站内消息并保持手机畅通。</span></span><span><span>复试采用机试</span>+<span>面试的形式，时间和地点安排如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报到：</span>9<span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日</span></span><span>15:00-18:00<span>，提交纸质版报名材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>机试：</span>9<span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span><span>8:00-10:00</span><span>，默认提供</span><span>C</span><span>、</span><span>C++</span><span>、</span><span>Java</span><span>程序语言的集成开发环境；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试：</span></span><span>9<span>月</span></span><span>18</span><span><span>日</span>10:</span><span>00</span><span><span>，</span>25<span>教学楼一楼报告厅候考。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>申请人提交的全部材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消其接收推免申请资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>已在我校</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>预</span></span><span><span>报名的</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>届时还</span></span><span><span>应</span></span><span><span>通过教育部</span><span>“</span><span>全国推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>注册并填报志愿，</span></span><span><span>并在学院规定时间内</span></span><span><span>按工作程序完成招生流程</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>全国推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>网址为：</span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/<span>，预计</span>9<span>月下旬开放报名，请申请人关注中国研究生招生信息网和</span></span><span><span>学院官网</span></span><span><span>通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>我校将根据教育部</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>最新推免政策</span></span><span><span>和学校相关文件要求</span></span><span><span>及时公布</span></span><span><span>西南</span></span><span><span>大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收推免生章程</span></span><span><span>及其他相关信息，</span></span><span><span>请</span></span><span><span>关注</span></span><span><span>西南大学研招网和学院官网</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>                                                               2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>附件：</span>1<span>．西南大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统操作步骤（考生端）</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"f32debe743a119ce88fc3b39a0a7eb976ffb5e30097b001712c353a5efe289fe","textLength":1393,"sourceSha256":"ba270799a8a4f1d20df90cd225e681d1ca12126cb8d14b58db7270ae57ad8f49","selector":".v_news_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1_西南大学2027年接收推免生预报名系统操作步骤（考生端）.docx","url":"https://cis.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1780571284&wbfileid=6F9344C9A1D9D04E1F73FB365B3ED284"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-eb4b6b21f834bb54a5b9","title":"2026年西南大学计算机与信息科学学院软件学院关于接收2027年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生的预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:27.646898+00:00"}
